{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Look among the nations and see</b> — whether you have heard such a thing." "<b>And be astounded</b> — from the hitpa'el pattern; and the full form is והתתמהו, for the root of תמה is [has a weak radical]." "<b>For a work is being wrought</b> — HaShem [is] in your days. And since it is well known that He is the one who works all, He did not state it explicitly."], :book :habakkuk, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["<b>Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk</b>- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"] ["Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:49.697057645Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}